    "name": "LabVantage LIMS Containers Results API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "LabVantage LIMS (Laboratory Information Management System) REST API for sample management, test result recording, instrument integration, and regulatory compliance data exchange. Supports GxP-compliant workflows for pharmaceutical, biotech, and clinical laboratory environments. The LabVantage REST API provides access to samples, tests, results, containers, and laboratory schedules via JSON over HTTPS.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: LabVantage Customer Care",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
